       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LVL88.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 STATUS-CODE PIC X VALUE "A".
          88 ACTIVE VALUE "A".
          88 CLOSED VALUE "C".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF ACTIVE DISPLAY "ACTIVE".
           SET CLOSED TO TRUE.
           IF CLOSED DISPLAY "NOW CLOSED".
           STOP RUN.
